+- `tools/profile_bridge_build.py` — capture/configuration and `execute`; retain descriptor-safe reads.
+- `tools/publication_authority.py` — `transition_inputs`, `evaluate_transition`, `profile_check`, `missing_prerequisites` own authenticated bindings, results and refusals.
+- `tools/phase_4_transition.py` — reuse `Control.bounded_process` unchanged.
+- Publication-validator BH2/BH3/EH2 define toolchain trust.
+
+## Tasks & Acceptance
+
+**Execution:**
+- [ ] `tools/ProductionProfileBridge/BuildProof.targets`, `tools/ProductionProfileBridge/ProductionProfileBridge.csproj` — add fixed observation targets and their sole explicit import; keep other imports/items closed. Observe task/compiler inputs and generated outputs.
+- [ ] `tools/profile_bridge_build.py` — capture the target; implement bounded preflight/stage checks. Resolve SDK/pack/runtime roots; combine evaluated/preprocessed imports with task/compiler observations covering sources, references, analyzers, additional files/configuration, response files and generated inputs. Classify inputs as verified snapshot, trusted toolchain or private output with verified producer/identity. Reject unknown paths, symlinks/escapes, incomplete observations and stage mutations. Bind proof to capture, installation, arguments/environment and invocation; preprocessing alone is insufficient.
+- [ ] `tools/profile_bridge_build.py` — suppress workload advertising using the SDK's supported opt-out; verify exact-environment process/network behavior including first use. Preserve offline restore controls.
+- [ ] `tools/publication_authority.py`, `tools/phase-4-transition.schema.json` — bind new controls/subjects, compare capture with authenticated head, recompute binding capacity. Replace only the unconditional build-input barrier with fixed verification; condition reporting on proof. Retain other barriers, head checks and owner-result validation.
