+- [ ] `tools/tests/check_production_profile_bridge.py` — require genuine v1/v2 golden results and stage observations; test actual ancestor/user/resolver/response poisoning, pack absence, generated-input tampering and workload process/network behavior. Unavailable tracing cannot pass.
+- [ ] `docs/architecture/publication-authority-v1.md` — document proved closure, supported resolution envelope and remaining barriers. Preserve workflow/publisher/SDK pins.
+
+**Acceptance Criteria:**
